   "text": "Container Apps environment\ncae-abw-priv-<region>-001\nInternal: VNet-only ingress. One image\n(abw-mcp); the MCP_SERVER setting picks\nthe server. 0.5 vCPU, 1 GiB, 1 to 2 replicas\neach.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d02_0093",
   "originalText": "Container Apps environment\ncae-abw-priv-<region>-001\nInternal: VNet-only ingress. One image\n(abw-mcp); the MCP_SERVER setting picks\nthe server. 0.5 vCPU, 1 GiB, 1 to 2 replicas\neach.",
