   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "NAT gateway ng-abw-demo-<region>-001 with public address pip-ng-abw-demo-<region>-001\nStandard SKU, one static IPv4 address, idle timeout 10 minutes. Attached to snet-mcp, snet-apim and snet-jump; not to snet-agent or snet-pe. This address is the only one allowed\nthrough the Key Vault firewall (public endpoint on, default action Deny, trusted Azure services bypass).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d02_0107",
   "originalText": "NAT gateway ng-abw-demo-<region>-001 with public address pip-ng-abw-demo-<region>-001\nStandard SKU, one static IPv4 address, idle timeout 10 minutes. Attached to snet-mcp, snet-apim and snet-jump; not to snet-agent or snet-pe. This address is the only one allowed\nthrough the Key Vault firewall (public endpoint on, default action Deny, trusted Azure services bypass).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
