   "text": "Azure Monitor ingestion\nTelemetry from the MCP apps and APIM. The Monitor Private Link Scope runs in\nOpen ingestion mode, so writers outside the VNet can still ingest.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
